This repository contains material under three different terms.

1. The demo, build system, tools and tests (MIT)

   Everything in this repository except data/FACES.DAT, the face pixels
   in tests/fixtures/ef_reference.h, the screenshots in doc/ (which show
   those faces) and third_party/ is released under the MIT License (see
   LICENSE).

2. Face images (Olivetti / AT&T face database)

   data/FACES.DAT, tests/fixtures/ef_reference.h and the screenshots in
   doc/ are derived from fifteen photographs in "The Database of Faces"
   (formerly "The ORL Database of Faces"), AT&T Laboratories Cambridge,
   obtained through scikit-learn's fetch_olivetti_faces. They are reduced
   to 24 x 24 pixels with 64 gray levels by tools/export_faces.py. The
   database's own terms apply to them, not the MIT License; its authors
   ask that any use acknowledge AT&T Laboratories Cambridge.

3. Atari DOS 2.5 (third_party/atari-dos25/)

   DOS.SYS and DUP.SYS are Atari DOS 2.5, copyright Atari. They are NOT
   covered by the MIT License, and are included only so that a bootable
   disk image can be built and the tests can run. See
   third_party/atari-dos25/README.md.

Build-time dependencies (not distributed)

   `make deps` downloads and builds the following into build/deps/. They
   are linked only into local test programs and dir2atr, which are never
   distributed with this project.

   - atari800 5.2.0 (libatari800), GPL-2.0-or-later
     https://github.com/atari800/atari800
   - AtariSIO 221009 (dir2atr), GPL-2.0-or-later
     https://www.horus.com/~hias/atari/

   `make data` and `make test-tools` use numpy, pillow and scikit-learn
   from tools/requirements.txt (BSD-style and HPND licenses); nothing from
   them is distributed.
